    <source>Melody verified against the Wikipedia LilyPond score (G major) and the FluteTree ABC (both 6/8 with an eighth-note pickup), transposed to C; pitches and octaves checked against onlinepianokeyboard (G) and ePiano (C, G3–G4). See song.json for sources. Left-hand part is a PianoFlow teaching setting.</source>
